/Alt (Diagram with two panels illustrating iron regulation mechanisms. Panel A shows ferroportin embedded in a membrane transporting Fe+2 ions downward inhibited by hepicidin. Panel B depicts how SIRTs 1 & 2 regulate ferroportin. SIRT1 deacetylates FoxO1 leading to hepicidin production which inhibits ferroportin. SIRT 2 deacetylates NRF2 which decreases ferroportin expression.)
